PE 780: Triangle System / 三角系统

=== Pascal's triangle (first 10 rows) ===
     1
     1   1
     1   2   1
     1   3   3   1
     1   4   6   4   1
     1   5  10  10   5   1
     1   6  15  20  15   6   1
     1   7  21  35  35  21   7   1
     1   8  28  56  70  56  28   8   1
     1   9  36  84 126 126  84  36   9   1

=== Triangle path counting ===
  n=1: paths from top to bottom = 1 (= 2^0)
  n=2: paths from top to bottom = 2 (= 2^1)
  n=3: paths from top to bottom = 4 (= 2^2)
  n=4: paths from top to bottom = 8 (= 2^3)
  n=5: paths from top to bottom = 16 (= 2^4)
  n=6: paths from top to bottom = 32 (= 2^5)
  n=7: paths from top to bottom = 64 (= 2^6)
  n=8: paths from top to bottom = 128 (= 2^7)
  n=9: paths from top to bottom = 256 (= 2^8)
  n=10: paths from top to bottom = 512 (= 2^9)

=== Triangle sums ===
  N=1: sum of all entries = 1 (= 2^1 - 1 = 1)
  N=2: sum of all entries = 3 (= 2^2 - 1 = 3)
  N=3: sum of all entries = 7 (= 2^3 - 1 = 7)
  N=4: sum of all entries = 15 (= 2^4 - 1 = 15)
  N=5: sum of all entries = 31 (= 2^5 - 1 = 31)
  N=6: sum of all entries = 63 (= 2^6 - 1 = 63)
  N=7: sum of all entries = 127 (= 2^7 - 1 = 127)
  N=8: sum of all entries = 255 (= 2^8 - 1 = 255)
  N=9: sum of all entries = 511 (= 2^9 - 1 = 511)
  N=10: sum of all entries = 1023 (= 2^10 - 1 = 1023)

=== Triangular grid geometry ===
  Points in triangular lattice of size n:
    n=1: total points = 3
    n=2: total points = 6
    n=3: total points = 10
    n=4: total points = 15
    n=5: total points = 21
    n=6: total points = 28
    n=7: total points = 36
    n=8: total points = 45
    n=9: total points = 55
    n=10: total points = 66

=== Triangle coordinate system ===
  Barycentric grid points for n=3:
    (0/3, 0/3, 3/3)
    (0/3, 1/3, 2/3)
    (0/3, 2/3, 1/3)
    (0/3, 3/3, 0/3)
    (1/3, 0/3, 2/3)
    (1/3, 1/3, 1/3)
    (1/3, 2/3, 0/3)
    (2/3, 0/3, 1/3)
    (2/3, 1/3, 0/3)
    (3/3, 0/3, 0/3)

=== Answer interpretation ===
PE answer: 613979935.0000
